      "id": "claim_f1880777471545f3aa045b551109f732",
      "statement": "The API diff compares two already-projected snapshots instead of translating model edits into routes: diffApiSnapshots throws API_MODEL_MISMATCH when the two model ids differ, and each route is normalized (fields, derived, stamped, outputFields, roles, responses and rules sorted) before canonical-JSON equality, so declaration reordering produces an empty diff.",
